        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erae ŋisabito ŋulutomonikanikaarei apaki ŋina etubunit Akuj akitiyakinia nu aŋuna a ŋituŋa kon ka aŋuna ke etaun a ŋolo asegan: Akitojoŋore ŋituŋa abilibil ŋikisila, akitojoŋore ŋituŋa asecenen, amookuun ŋituŋa anaronisya kec, ayaun lotuŋa akiyookino ŋinaruba ka akisiyookin akisileerekinet ka ŋakiro a ŋikadwarak ta akitaleun akibois ŋina asegan nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, toyenu atemar ameun anapaki a ŋina alimorere atemar emaikina kinyakunae Yerusalem ka todukoe nabo, akitodol apaki ŋina ebunio ekarikon ŋolo eseunit Akuj, eyakaun ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋikanikaomwon ka alotooma ŋikaru ŋamiae ŋaomwon ka ŋatomonikanikapei ka ŋiomwon, edukokinio Yerusalem nabo toyakaun ŋirotin ŋulu ke etaun ka ŋarwatatain ŋuna erae ŋatabab ewuatere etaun, nai itiyao ŋun anapaki a ŋina a ŋican. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋikaru a ŋamiae a ŋaomwon ka ŋatomonikanikapei ka ŋiomwon earyo ekarikon ŋolo eseunit Akuj, edaun ibore ŋini erae ŋini keŋ, ido emunaarete ŋasigarya a ekarikon a ŋolo ilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ etaun ka akibois ŋina ka Akai ka Akuj. Ebuni asalun keŋ lopite ŋolo ebunio akalele, eyakaun ejie akitodol nasalunet. Atubun atemar eyakaun ekasile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwuakini nai ekarikon ŋol acamunet ŋina agogoŋon ka ŋituŋa ŋulu alalak, acamunet ŋina iboi ŋikaru ŋikanikaarei, ani elunyar atutubet apei ŋina a ŋikaru a ŋul, elemari iŋes ŋamuronisya ka ŋainakineta. Iwuakinio neni sek eayeneneo ikes etorube ŋolo aronon ŋolo asiilyanan ŋolo eyauni ekasile. Erubakini iŋes eyai nen akitodol ŋina emunaarya Akuj ŋini abu kiwuak etorube ŋolo nen, itiyakin ŋun lopite ŋolo etubunitor Akuj.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
